    "fillPolygonsWhy": "the Xcaret airspace: the open water between the submerged passage and the ledge at surface, white on the map (traced from the paper region the ledge, the rubble islands and the two 'edge of Xcaret airspace' marks enclose); the 4 metre pit, drawn white in the passage; cenote de Felipe's pool (a dotted outline open on the passage's east wall) and cenote de los franceses (a dotted ring in the passage): open water, part of the cave",
